  </data>
  <data name="ConnectionDetailsEncryptionBody" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>FTPS Server encrypts both commands and data.
It supports only EXPLICIT TLS (AUTH TLS / FTP over TLS).

In the client, choose:

  Protocol: FTP
  Encryption: Explicit TLS
    (FileZilla: "Require explicit FTP over TLS"
     WinSCP: "TLS/SSL Explicit encryption"
     Cyberduck: "FTP-SSL (Explicit AUTH TLS)")

Do not choose Implicit FTPS (often labeled only "FTPS") — it will not connect.</value>
